":"https://github.com/jrvidal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/75691490","html_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/1587#issuecomment-75691490","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/1587","id":75691490,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc1NjkxNDkw","user":{"login":"jrvidal","id":1636604,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzY2MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1636604?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal","html_url":"https://github.com/jrvidal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-02-24T03:18:57Z","updated_at":"2015-02-24T03:18:57Z","body":"Making progress.\n- I'm confused by [this check](https://github.com/eslint/eslint/blob/master/lib/rules/comma-spacing.js#L77):\n  \n  ``` javascript\n  if (isSameLine(previousItemToken, commaToken) &&\n                  isSameLine(commaToken, currentItemToken)\n      ) {\n          // Check spacing around a comma\n      }\n  ```\n  \n  We only check the spacing if the the comma, left and right tokens are in the same line. But shouldn't this be reported as invalid?\n  \n  ``` javascript\n  // comma-first mode, space after comma\n  var x = 1\n      ,y = 1;\n  ```\n- Shouldn't this rule include destructuring?\n  \n  ``` javascript\n  var [x ,y, ,z] = list;\n  ```\n  \n  It should probably be a separate issue though.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/75691490/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jrvidal","id":1636604,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzY2MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1636604?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal","html_url":"https://github.com/jrvidal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrvidal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/iss